        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Takedowns on enemy champions, large minions, and large monsters grant Shyvana Scalemail stacks, improving her defenses.",
        "bodyHtml": "Takedowns on champions, large minions, and monsters earn Shyvana stacks of <span>? </span>, each stack grants Shyvana permanent <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">0.3 Armor</span> and <span>0.3 Magic Resist</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Bonus Armor: 0.3</span><br /><span>Bonus Magic Resist: 0.3</span>",
