      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "ShyvanaQ",
        "name": "Emberstrike",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shyvana's next attack strikes both the target and the surrounding area. This Ability can be recast. While in Dragon Form, it gains an additional recast, dealing massive damage to a single target.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Shyvana's Attacks deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(1% + (0.01% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health magic damage</span> <span> On-Hit</span> and reduce this Ability's Cooldown by 0.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Shyvana's next Attack strikes the target and the surrounding area dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20/25/30 + (110% Attack Damage) + (30% Ability Power)) physical damage</span>. This Ability may be <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> after an Attack or short delay within the next 4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form:</span> Shyvana gains an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span>, causing her to bite the target of her next Attack dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(15/22.5/30/37.5/45 + (165% Attack Damage) + (45% Ability Power)) true damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 10 additional damage to monsters.<br />Maximum health damage does not affect structures and against non-champions has a minimum of 10 and maximum of 200.<br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form's</span> final <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> cannot critically strike.</span>",
        "iconFile": "ShyvanaQ.png",
