      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "ShyvanaE",
        "name": "Molten Burst",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shyvana launches a fireball that explodes upon striking a large target and slows them. In Dragon Form, it passes through and explodes upon striking large enemies, leaving behind a trail of fire.",
        "bodyHtml": "Shyvana launches a fireball at the target location dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/65/80/95/110 + (60/65/70/75/80% Ability Power)) + 5% Max health magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing by 30% for 2 seconds</span>. It explodes upon striking an enemy or reaching its terminus.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form:</span> Shyvana's fireball is larger and pierces through enemies. Upon striking a champion, large monster, or reaching its terminus it triggers a pulse of fire that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(62.5/81.25/100/118.75/137.5 + (75/81.25/87.5/93.75/100% Ability Power)) + 6.25% Max Health magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows by 30% for 2 seconds</span>. The fireball leaves behind a trail for 2 seconds that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25 + (5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Overlapping <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form</span> explosions deal 40% damage.</span>",
